{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0234_1000_p", "source_sha256": "c2d255bf14c1110f79e5a893e17b027f460a3deedba4bea17f59376be00206d6", "ja": "おつかれさま、桃子。衣装はどうだ？\nブログでは気に入ってるって書いてたけど……。", "zh": "辛苦了，桃子。这套服装感觉怎么样？\n你在博客上写着很喜欢，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0234_1001_049mom", "source_sha256": "730794c68c420f61707eb7d772dacd56cc90f0cbbc31587cb79b6014e9edb861", "ja": "あっ、お兄ちゃん！　うん、すごくかわいいよ。\nイメージどおりで、ちょっとビックリしちゃった。", "zh": "啊，哥哥！嗯，特别可爱哦。\n和我想象的一样，真让我有点惊讶。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0234_1002_049mom", "source_sha256": "58a3e17dca1edd59c777fa7c2705a8b25d4c371332011e746f0f0bc5bdd4ffea", "ja": "桃子のアイディア、ちゃんとデザイナーさんに\n伝えてくれたんだね。ほめてあげる♪", "zh": "你把桃子的想法好好传达给设计师了呢。值得表扬♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0234_1003_p", "source_sha256": "4b41e8e206016fe216ecc3a029a779554281aa17d8f7240b6744c2c33ea51a44", "ja": "「かわいくデコってほしい」って言われてたからな。\nイメージどおりなら、良かった。", "zh": "因为你当时跟我说「希望能装饰得可爱一点」嘛。\n要是符合你的设想就太好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0234_1004_049mom", "source_sha256": "1e2fc0268ad3a8bb54938bc3b5d9f8ad7f176da8cc847c5d425ef471f26474e2", "ja": "そうだよ！　だってアイドルは、\nみんなに夢や希望を与えるのがお仕事なんでしょ？", "zh": "没错呀！因为偶像的工作，就是为大家带来梦想和希望，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0234_1005_049mom", "source_sha256": "0eb985345c205b2f3524ca8fe9abe975709c17224f264e4db99e3e2977ce3c77", "ja": "桃子がみんなにあげる、夢や希望……\nそれなら、かわいい衣装が一番だと思ったんだ。", "zh": "桃子带给大家的梦想和希望……既然如此，我觉得可爱的服装最合适。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0234_1006_p", "source_sha256": "a5ce57f301f29211bcb0c51c86ebea94918f90e685f4016d16067bba0cb3ff40", "ja": "なるほど。可愛さは、確かに桃子の売りのひとつだけど\n……ただ、夢は人それぞれだからな。", "zh": "原来如此。可爱确实是桃子的一大卖点，不过……\n梦想是因人而异的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0234_1007_049mom", "source_sha256": "c4b3d08ec84a177f8da193e6e407bf2279613bfddb356882dce0cd4e1aec7ccb", "ja": "夢は人それぞれって……\nどういうこと？　お兄ちゃん。", "zh": "每个人的梦想各不相同……\n这是什么意思啊？大哥哥。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0234_1008_049mom", "source_sha256": "49c3d54d649134eb4234810a99c15b15c0f6614f0eae209345dec8b55a40a28e", "ja": "もしかして……桃子じゃ、\nみんなに夢を見せられないってこと……？", "zh": "难道说……意思是桃子，\n没办法让大家看到梦想吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0234_1009_p", "source_sha256": "c164ed20467bdd28c09faa36a9ccabad39393a24e40c5cdf2db074531c2c4c2a", "ja": "そうじゃないよ。衣装も大事だけど……みんなに\n夢を見せられるのは、あくまで桃子本人だって事だ。", "zh": "不是那样。服装固然重要……但能让大家看到梦想的，归根结底还是桃子本人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0234_1010_p", "source_sha256": "02548f75021948e07f422e34c079749a9da913c8b3de30c359cf5f1460cbc18b", "ja": "あとは、同じ夢を見たいって思ってくれる、\nファンの人達の存在かな。", "zh": "还有就是，希望能做同一场梦的\n粉丝们的存在吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0234_1011_049mom", "source_sha256": "e538c81a7dc1db8b3dd7b10c2bd6eabd8449cd6801369118f206744884a9b7a2", "ja": "べ、べつに……それくらい、桃子だってわかってるし。\n衣装がかわいいからって、手を抜いたりしないよ！", "zh": "没、没什么……这种程度的事，桃子当然明白啦。  \n就算服装很可爱，我也不会因此偷懒！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0234_1012_p", "source_sha256": "e160ba6d929d01da6fc7fd4228fa76542804f330b31e8aa839f2a9bb4ae778d4", "ja": "ああ、そうだな。でも俺としては、桃子自身の夢も\n叶うような衣装であってほしいと思ってるよ。", "zh": "啊，是啊。不过我还是希望这套服装也能帮助桃子实现属于自己的梦想。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0234_1013_049mom", "source_sha256": "196c00d96fd30c07d965b04fb45fd72e40de625c5d49a1bba908116264b29805", "ja": "桃子の夢？\nでも、桃子は……。", "zh": "桃子的梦想？\n可是，桃子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0234_1014_p", "source_sha256": "773ba0e4ccab4a766071ec1c02c589236a3bced4b89e03f9f21d18f96287987a", "ja": "桃子が願うのが難しいなら、今は俺が願っておくよ。\n俺は、アイドルの夢を叶えるプロデューサーだからな！", "zh": "如果桃子很难许愿的话，现在就由我来替你许愿吧。\n因为我是帮助偶像实现梦想的制作人嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0234_1015_049mom", "source_sha256": "23b6fceec4ca8495bdf29e012e855cce293261c39572751fe04d8508862fc017", "ja": "も、もう。\nお兄ちゃんのくせに、ナマイキだよ……。", "zh": "真、真是的。\n明明只是个大哥哥，还挺狂妄的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0234_1016_049mom", "source_sha256": "d6ef127d34f801522f5bc02ea973cdb6d7ea99c0855c04f7b66642653c149e94", "ja": "それにお兄ちゃんは、プロデューサーなんだから。\nファンのみんなのことを一番に考えなきゃでしょ？", "zh": "而且哥哥可是制作人，必须把粉丝们放在第一位，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0234_1017_p", "source_sha256": "713645e2d39194673c2ed5534e342a4de7763152be8d19f441928ac1653ab7bf", "ja": "おっと……そうだったな。", "zh": "哦……对啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0234_1018_049mom", "source_sha256": "a6671e55eae94083fd5c0b2313a50fe526161e0bf4b748eebbba53743ad2f543", "ja": "わかったなら、もういいよ。\nこの話は、もうおしまい！", "zh": "既然明白了，那就没事了。\n这件事就到此为止！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0234_1019_049mom", "source_sha256": "40191d6c1aba6f663ff4d329790e2c8ed823ab6788cfd330d19ee8864931c01b", "ja": "お兄ちゃんが桃子のことを考えてくれてるのは、\nちゃんとわかったから。……ありがとう。", "zh": "桃子已经明白哥哥一直在为她着想了……谢谢你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0234_1020_049mom", "source_sha256": "692b6adf697d36f4f2926c8ffa29064300f061b66618af714801736289874cc5", "ja": "衣装はバッチリだから、次は桃子ががんばる番だね。\n桃子のステージ、しっかり見ててね？　お兄ちゃん♪", "zh": "服装已经准备好了，接下来就该桃子好好加油了。哥哥，要好好看桃子的舞台哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
